  "StockRole": "Tribe Command Juggernaut",
  "YangsThoughts": "The Hierophant is a 200-ton superheavy OmniMech fielded by the Minnesota Tribe as a battlefield oracle, commanding, interpreting, and unleashing battlefield truth with devastating clarity. Named for the ancient spiritual title of one who reveals sacred mysteries, the Hierophant embodies the Tribe’s view of war as a ritual of revelation. Exclusively piloted by high-ranking commanders, it serves as both a strategic nerve center and an unyielding war idol. Powered by a volatile Magnothermic Plasma Engine and cooled with advanced Plasmo-Electric Heat Sinks, the Hierophant stands as a towering symbol of the Tribe’s grim, transcendent purpose.",
